{
    "title": "Baby Rattle: Giggles & Lullaby",
    "description": "Make your infant giggle with joy! \r\nLet your toddler play with Cute, interactive Rattle Toys\r\n\r\nJust choose the Rattle character your baby boy or girl likes and shake the phone for joyful sounds, tap it for more animations and effects!\r\n\r\nHear them giggle with joy - Play with your infant!\r\n \u25ba Calm crying baby with cute characters and engaging sounds!\r\n \u25ba Shake the phone for rattle sounds\r\n \u25ba Tap - for additional animations and effects\r\n \u25ba Sleep & Lullaby mode - Sleepy sounds and animations: make your infant or toddler go to sleep (White noise alternative)\r\n \r\nFeatures: \r\n \u25ba 30 Rattle toys\r\n \u25ba Interactive characters\r\n \u25ba Cute animations\r\n \u25ba Engaging, lively sounds\r\n \u25ba Ads Free!\r\n \u25ba Use Offline - No internet connection required!\r\n \u25ba For infants and toddlers\r\n\r\nBeing a parent is fun but it's never easy, especially when you have a newborn baby. The Baby Rattle toys app will help new parents in hard times to calm the baby and during a play time to make it even more enjoyable, to hear the baby giggle with joy!\r\n\r\nRattle app can be used when:\r\n \u25ba You need some new interactive toys and sounds to get infant's attention and make him or her play and have fun\r\n \u25ba Baby needs to go to sleep - lullaby mode\r\n \u25ba Little one starts crying and you need something to distract and calm your baby girl or boy down\r\n\r\nRattle toys are intended for parents to play with their infants under 1 year old, or for toddlers who can enjoy and play with it on their own.\r\nEnjoy your time with your family!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make your infant giggle with joy! <br>Let your toddler play with Cute, interactive Rattle Toys<br><br>Just choose the Rattle character your baby boy or girl likes and shake the phone for joyful sounds, tap it for more animations and effects!<br><br>Hear them giggle with joy - Play with your infant!<br> \u25ba Calm crying baby with cute characters and engaging sounds!<br> \u25ba Shake the phone for rattle sounds<br> \u25ba Tap - for additional animations and effects<br> \u25ba Sleep &amp; Lullaby mode - Sleepy sounds and animations: make your infant or toddler go to sleep (White noise alternative)<br> <br>Features: <br> \u25ba 30 Rattle toys<br> \u25ba Interactive characters<br> \u25ba Cute animations<br> \u25ba Engaging, lively sounds<br> \u25ba Ads Free!<br> \u25ba Use Offline - No internet connection required!<br> \u25ba For infants and toddlers<br><br>Being a parent is fun but it&#39;s never easy, especially when you have a newborn baby. The Baby Rattle toys app will help new parents in hard times to calm the baby and during a play time to make it even more enjoyable, to hear the baby giggle with joy!<br><br>Rattle app can be used when:<br> \u25ba You need some new interactive toys and sounds to get infant&#39;s attention and make him or her play and have fun<br> \u25ba Baby needs to go to sleep - lullaby mode<br> \u25ba Little one starts crying and you need something to distract and calm your baby girl or boy down<br><br>Rattle toys are intended for parents to play with their infants under 1 year old, or for toddlers who can enjoy and play with it on their own.<br>Enjoy your time with your family!",
